{"scene_id": "s00500", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00500.fountain", "heading": "INT. AUCTION HOUSE - BACK ROOM - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CORNELIUS WREN", "names": ["CORNELIUS WREN", "CORNELIUS"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 10}, {"id": 1, "name": "PHILIPPA VANTONGEREN", "names": ["PHILIPPA VANTONGEREN", "PHILIPPA"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 2, "name": "DETECTIVE ANSELM OBI", "names": ["DETECTIVE ANSELM OBI", "ANSELM"], "gender": "m", "first": 27, "spoke": 3}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. AUCTION HOUSE - BACK ROOM - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A narrow room behind the sale floor.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Velvet-draped easels.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A single tall window.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Through the wall, the muffled voice of an auctioneer and the occasional rap of a gavel.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "CORNELIUS WREN (60s, tweed, silk pocket square) sits at a polished table with a cup of tea, serene.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from him, PHILIPPA VANTONGEREN (40s, tailored suit, folder in her lap) sits very upright, a pen between her fingers.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'll find the provenance is impeccable.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm sure.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Painted in 1884. Single owner since 1921. Never exhibited.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Never exhibited.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Never.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "He sips.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "She taps the pen against the folder.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Her eyes stay on the cup.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My dear, you look unwell.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm well.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've hardly touched your biscuit.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't care for biscuits.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No one cares for them. They are an excuse for tea.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She smiles, briefly.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The gavel falls in the next room.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So. Shall we sign?", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of course.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "She opens the folder and slides a document across the table.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "He reads it, uncaps his fountain pen, and begins to sign.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "The door opens.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "A tall man in a navy suit enters without knocking: DETECTIVE ANSELM OBI (50s, badge on his belt, hands in his pockets).", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "He closes the door behind him.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Wren.", "name": "ANSELM", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This is a private meeting.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know. I've been listening to it for twenty minutes.", "name": "ANSELM", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Philippa sets down her pen.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "She lifts the collar of her blouse and reveals a small wire.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Me.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Cornelius stands so fast his chair goes over.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "He lunges for the document; she snatches it.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "He reaches for the window latch; Anselm catches his arm and twists it behind his back, and they stagger together against the easel, which topples, and a velvet cloth slides off a tarnished gold frame to reveal a painting of a small girl in a blue dress holding an apple.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "The three of them stare.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not a Corot.", "name": "ANSELM", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a very good copy.", "name": "CORNELIUS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["strangled"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a very good forgery.", "name": "PHILIPPA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "In the sale room, the gavel falls again.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}